# d4-snp-wb-race: F20 injection edition. Dirty writebacks forced in a
# burst while the ChiSnCore snoops race the eviction stream.
# Geometry: all 16 lines share L2 set 0x180 AND one L3 set (stride
# 0x40000), so the 8 fresh dirty evictors in phase 2 must write back the
# 8 old dirty holders one after another; the .snp schedule interleaves
# SnpShared/SnpUnique/SnpCleanInvalid/SnpMakeInvalid with that stream
# (old lines: snoop-vs-writeback race; new lines: resident-dirty snoop).
# Readback refetches all 16 lines afterwards; data check = the matrix
# write formula (addr>>(i%8))+i per byte.
# phase 1: 8 old dirty holders (agent1 PutFullData)
MW 0x000000006000 1
MW 0x000000046000 1
MW 0x000000086000 1
MW 0x0000000c6000 1
MW 0x000000106000 1
MW 0x000000146000 1
MW 0x000000186000 1
MW 0x0000001c6000 1
FE 0x000000000000 0
# phase 2: 8 fresh dirty lines evict the holders -- writeback burst races
# the injected snoops (no fence inside the stream)
MW 0x000000206000 1
MW 0x000000246000 1
MW 0x000000286000 1
MW 0x0000002c6000 1
MW 0x000000306000 1
MW 0x000000346000 1
MW 0x000000386000 1
MW 0x0000003c6000 1
FE 0x000000000000 0
# phase 3: readback all 16 lines (old-line hits are now misses refetched
# from L3 with the written-back data)
MR 0x000000006000 1
MR 0x000000046000 1
MR 0x000000086000 1
MR 0x0000000c6000 1
MR 0x000000106000 1
MR 0x000000146000 1
MR 0x000000186000 1
MR 0x0000001c6000 1
MR 0x000000206000 1
MR 0x000000246000 1
MR 0x000000286000 1
MR 0x0000002c6000 1
MR 0x000000306000 1
MR 0x000000346000 1
MR 0x000000386000 1
MR 0x0000003c6000 1
FE 0x000000000000 0
